B.ccC=new A.y("church","[Set 31] I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.cph=new A.y("church","[Set 31] Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.cpt=new A.y("church","Deep riddle #948 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.cfN=new A.y("church","[Set 31] Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.cl0=new A.y("church","Challenge 950: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.cpk=new A.y("logic","Deep riddle #951 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I?","A hole")
B.ch3=new A.y("logic","[Set 31] I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A map")
B.cf7=new A.y("logic","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth and hear without ears; I have no body but come alive with wind. What am I?","An echo")
B.cel=new A.y("logic","Deep riddle #954 \u2014 Born tall, I die short; every word I carry shrinks me. What am I?","A candle")
B.cnm=new A.y("logic","Challenge 955: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
B.cbR=new A.y("nature","[Set 31] I fall but never get hurt; I blanket the world in white silence. What am I?","Snow")
B.cey=new A.y("nature","Deep riddle #957 \u2014 I have no lungs yet I hold every breath of the forest. What am I?","A tree")
B.chI=new A.y("mystery","[Set 31] I am seen in mirrors yet never in the same room twice. What am I?","Your reflection leaving")
B.ciP=new A.y("mystery","[Set 31] Doors open for me though I carry no key; time is my ally. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A habit")
B.cjo=new A.y("wordplay","Challenge 960: What word becomes shorter when you add two letters to it?","Short (adding -er)")
B.cj4=new A.y("logic","Logic puzzle #992: a number times itself minus 82 equals 7314. What is the number?","86")
B.cpA=new A.y("love","[Set 32] I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.cjf=new A.y("love","[Set 32] Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.cp6=new A.y("love","Deep riddle #963 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.cmb=new A.y("love","[Set 32] I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.cn5=new A.y("love","Challenge 965: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.cgc=new A.y("bible","Deep riddle #966 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I? (Think carefully.)","The great fish")
B.cco=new A.y("bible","[Set 32] Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I?","Noah's ark")
B.chb=new A.y("bible","[Set 32] I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
